      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaayogera ninze, nga Nebuzaradani omukulu w'abaisirukale amaze okunsibulula mu ikomera e Rama. Eyo baali bantwaireyo nga bansibye ku ndhegere, ghalala n'abantu boonaboona abaatoolebwa mu Yerusalemu ni mu Buyudaaya nga bali kutwalibwa e Babilonia mu bunhage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukulu w'abaisirukale oyo yandhiza gha mbali, yankoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda wo yeesoomera okuleetera ensi eno okuzikirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mperaano akituukiriiza kye yakoba okukola. Ebyo byonabyona bibairegho, lwa kuba abantu bo baakola ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda era baamudheemera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona, mperaano ndi kukusibululaku endhegere dhino ku mikono obe wa idembe. Bw'oba oyenda okuja ninze e Babilonia, idha tuje, era ndidha kukulabiriranga bulungi. Aye bw'oba toyenda kuja, otaidha. Bona, ensi yoonayoona eri agho ekuteegereire. Londaku gh'oyenda okuja woonawoona, oje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yankoba ati: “Bw'oba ng'onaasigala, irayo ye Gedalia mutabane wa Ahikamu era mwidhukulu wa Shafani, kyabazinga w'e Babilonia ye yagha okufuga Buyudaaya. Osobola okusigala n'oyo, olwo waaba ng'osigaire mu bantu be bataatwala Babilonia mu bunhage, oba okuja aghandi woonawoona gh'oyenda okuja.” Agho omukulu w'abaisirukale oyo yampa eby'okulya era yampa n'ekirabo, memale yandeka naaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naaja ye Gedalia e Mizipa, naabanga eyo ghalala naye mu bantu be bataatwala Babilonia mu bunhage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
