            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.22+2KI.25.23+2KI.25.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 25:22-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ghaaligho abandi ku bakulu mu magye ga Buyudaaya n'abaisirukale baibwe abaali mu irungu, nga bakaali kweghaayo kwira ku luuyi lwa kyabazinga w'e Babilonia. Bwe baawulira nga kyabazinga w'e Babilonia aghaire Gedalia mutabane wa Ahikamu okufuga ensi yaibwe n'abantu boonaboona abasembayo okuba abaavu abataatwalibwa Babilonia mu bunhage, baidha eri Gedalia oyo e Mizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaidha baali bano: Ishimaeli mutabane wa Nethania, ni Yohanani mutabane wa Karea, ni Seraia mutabane wa Tanhumethi, ni batabane ba Efai ow'e Netofa, ni Yezania mutabane w'omusaadha ow'e Maaka. Era baidha nga bali ghalala n'abaisirukale baibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedalia yaabalayirira ghalala n'abaisirukale baibwe, ng'akoba ati: “Mutatya kugheereza Bababilonia. Imwe musigale mu nsi eno mugheereze bugheereze kyabazinga w'e Babilonia, byonabyona biidha kubajiira bukalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze mwene ndidha kuba e Mizipa nsobole okuboogereragho imwe nga Abababilonia baidhie ye tuli. Aye imwe muje mube mu byalo byaimwe, musoloze era mutereke omwenge ogw'emizabbibu, n'ebibala eby'ekyengera, n'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nsambo n'endala, Abayudaaya abandi abaali mu Moabu, ni mu Ammoni, ni mu Edomu, ni mu nsi edhindi, baawulira nga kyabazinga ow'e Babilonia yaganha Abayudaaya abandi okusigala mu Buyudaaya era nga Gedalia ni ye yabagha okubafuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale baava eyo yoonayoona ye baali basansaaniire, baira mu Buyudaaya. Baaja e Mizipa ye Gedalia era baasoloza omwenge ogw'emizabbibu n'ebibala eby'ekyengera kamaala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yohanani mutabane wa Karea, n'abakulu ab'abaisirukale abaali mu irungu abaaloba okweghaayo okwira ku luuyi lwa kyabazinga w'e Babilonia, baidha ye Gedalia e Mizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakoba Gedalia bati: “Oidhi nga kyabazinga Baalisi owa Ammoni yatuma Ishimaeli aidhe akutemule?” Aye Gedalia yaaloba kukiikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yohanani yaamukoba mu kyama ati: “Ka nje ndhite Ishimaeli, ghazira aidha kumanha amwise. Lwaki tumuganha okukutemula? Ekyo kiidha kuleetera Abayudaaya boonaboona abeesololeza ghano gh'oli okusansaana, era kireeta akabi ku abo abaasigala mu Buyudaaya boonaboona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Gedalia yaamwiramu ati: “Otakikola. Ebyo bye muli kwogera ku Ishimaeli ti bituufu naire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
